  "content": "\n\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/xsnn6nf\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Extended Illumina</span> 由 </strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbeacons.ai%252filyastik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ilyastik</a></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Extended Illumina 是一款資源包，為您的手持物品新增 3D 燈籠與火把，非常適合用於沉浸式角色扮演體驗。</strong></span></p>\n<p><em style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Extended Illumina 並未新增自訂模型或紋理，因此可與絕大多數的燈籠或火把資源包相容。</em></span></em></p>\n<p><em style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>DYNAMIC LIGHTS</em></span> 推薦使用以獲得更佳體驗！</em></p>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<p><strong>Not Enough Animations 支援：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/extended-illumina-not-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended Illumina（Not Enough Animations 版）</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>1.12 - 26.2</strong></p>\n<p>🧡</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
